<Slide style={{ background: '#0B1020', padding: 60 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>整体方案</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>03 / 技术路线与选型</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.4)', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, marginTop: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 22, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>技术路线</Text>
            <Box style={{ gap: 10, marginTop: 16 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>前端</span>：React 18 + TypeScript + Vite，纯逻辑与副作用分层
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>存储</span>：IndexedDB（Dexie）v1→v4 迁移 + SQLite（聚合侧）
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>AI</span>：OpenAI 兼容协议，DeepSeek / Ollama / 自定义三选一
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>桌面壳</span>：Tauri 2（Rust 484 行），只做 Web 做不到的
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>聚合服务</span>：Python + FastAPI，常驻本机 127.0.0.1
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 22, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F0ABFC' }}>为什么这么选</Text>
            <Box style={{ gap: 10, marginTop: 16 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>Tauri 而非 Electron</span>：产物 27MB，Electron 通常 80MB+
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>OpenAI 兼容协议</span>：换模型只改地址与模型名，云端/本地同一套代码
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>聚合独立成服务</span>：浏览器关了也要继续抓；且多数站点不给 CORS
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>三套检索并存</span>：快而准 / 按意思 / 会推理，各补一段
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>零外链</span>：断网能打开，不依赖 CDN 存活
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginTop: 22 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 2, padding: 18, background: 'linear-gradient(120deg, #4F46E5 0%, #151B33 100%)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F0ABFC' }}>关键取舍</span>
                ：把 AI 做成"可断开的插件" —— 断开了它仍是完整工具，接上了才帮你理解与检索。
                代价是要为每一条云端能力都写一条本地降级路径。
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 18, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>15,173</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 6 }}>行 TS/TSX + 484 行 Rust + 5,192 行 Python</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 670 }}>个人工作台 · v0.2.0</Text>
</Slide>
